sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant Mobile as Expo Mobile App
  participant Gateway as API Gateway
  participant ReviewService as Review Service
  participant ReviewDb as trust_and_reputation
  participant BookingService as Booking Service
  participant BookingDb as booking
  participant CatalogService as Catalog Service
  participant CatalogDb as provider_catalog

  Customer->>Mobile: Submit rating and review
  Mobile->>Gateway: POST /v1/reviews
  Gateway->>Gateway: Validate customer token
  Gateway->>ReviewService: POST /internal/reviews
  ReviewService->>BookingService: Verify completed booking and participants
  BookingService->>BookingDb: Read booking
  BookingDb-->>BookingService: Completed booking
  BookingService-->>ReviewService: Review is allowed
  ReviewService->>ReviewDb: Insert or update review
  ReviewDb-->>ReviewService: ReviewSummary
  ReviewService->>CatalogService: Update provider rating summary
  CatalogService->>CatalogDb: Store average rating and review count
  ReviewService-->>Gateway: ReviewSummary
  Gateway-->>Mobile: Saved review
